#: __init__.py:16
msgid "Push selected books and their metadata into your Readest cloud library. Re-pushing a book updates its existing entry instead of creating a duplicate."
msgstr "將選取的書籍及其中繼資料推送至您的 Readest 雲端書庫。重新推送同一本書會更新現有條目，而非建立重複項目。"

#: config.py:36
msgid "Not logged in."
msgstr "尚未登入。"

#: config.py:42
msgid "Include custom columns in pushed metadata"
msgstr "在推送的中繼資料中包含自訂欄位"

#: config.py:51
msgid "Only change this if you run a self-hosted Readest server."
msgstr "僅在您運行自架 Readest 伺服器時才修改此設定。"

#: config.py:36 ui.py:136
msgid "Logged in as %s."
msgstr "已登入：%s。"

#: config.py:47
msgid "API server:"
msgstr "API 伺服器："

#: config.py:38
msgid "Use the Readest toolbar menu to log in or out."
msgstr "請使用 Readest 工具列選單登入或登出。"

